                "text": "Rebuilding trust in our public health institutions starts with ensuring Americans have access to factual information and quality care\u2014and that our healthcare systems are equipped with the resources they need. Met with @RobertKennedyJr, President Trump\u2019s HHS Secretary nominee, to discuss his plans to rebuild public trust in our health systems. I also expressed my healthcare priorities for Utah and the country\u2014including promoting safe and effective vaccines, ensuring the safety of our food and water supply, and enacting a bill I secured into law that equips medical systems with the critical minerals they need to operate.",
