                "text": "It\u2019s not fair or honest to address the national debt without discussing programs like Medicare and Social Security\u2014the largest drivers of our annual deficit. We can make responsible choices today, or our children and grandchildren will face harsher consequences tomorrow. https://t.co/5322hFWK7w",
